      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " WeekDays hours (after clg 3.30PM) (10min break after 50 min)\n - 3:30-6:00 DSA \n - 6:30-8:00 LLD \n - 9:30-11:00 CS fundamentals\n - 11:00-12:00 Credit (Movie, series etc)\n - 12:00-7:30 sleep\n - 8:15-3:00 clg\n if get time in clg then spent it on project and OSS",
